  "answer": "不能这样等同。CuriousLLM 的特殊 token 在原文中的定位是：后续问题“use special tokens to signify that the retrieved evidence is sufficient”[chunk_43145c0748762d6b4c650c65721f826f]。Tree-of-Traversals 方面，达到 max depth 时算法“forced to transition to the done state (i.e., answer the query)”，达到 max expansions 后则“halts exploration and returns \"Cannot find answer\"”[chunk_dac5f23e1b87249cf88eff5c6cc54355]，因此两种上限并不都表示证据充分、答案正确；其中 max expansions 明确对应找不到答案。",
